From: =?UTF-8?q?=C3=98yvind=20Harboe?= <oyvind.harboe@zylin.com>
Subject: [PATCH] ram: test BUILD's per-test data in sorted order
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Buildifier's unsorted-dict-items lint: the new tests' entries in the
per-test data dictionary are sorted by name. No change to what any test
reads.

Commit 18 of 23 in OpenROAD #11723, carried here from it. Not
upstreamed; retires at a //:bump onto an OpenROAD that has it.
---
 src/ram/test/BUILD | 62 +++++++++++++++++++++++-----------------------
 1 file changed, 31 insertions(+), 31 deletions(-)

